<title>USA: Sanmina completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Sanmina completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanmina Corp, a maker of electronics products, said on Friday it has completed a $17.6 million acquisition of certain assets of Comptronix Corp, a contract manufacturing company in Alabama.</p>
<p>The assets include Comptronix's plant and equipment located in Guntersville, its Guaymas, Mexico operations, customer contracts, inventories and accounts receivable.</p>
